{"2738530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rinth", "steam_appid": 2738530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rinth is an old school dungeon rpg inspired by 90s dungeon crawlers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the dungeons, face different monsters and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >chill mouse only gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect weapons</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buy and sell weapons to merchants</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >craft weapons on anvil (3 same rarity weapons will create a better one)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >make decisions when to buy/sell and craft items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >random generated dungeons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >total 5 different dungeons, (10 levels each dungeon)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After beating all 50 levels you can do endless dungeons (has bosses too)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rinth is a short game, around 4-5 hours to complete everything</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Style</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy pixel graphics and listen great 16-bit music during the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Can you save the world from evil?</i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rinth is an 